      <MissionDesc>THE CENTER FOR WORLD MUSIC IS A SAN DIEGO ORGANIZATION FOSTERING INTERCULTURAL AWARENESS THROUGH THE WORLDS PERFORMING ARTS TRADITIONS. WE CREATE ENGAGING EDUCATIONAL AND PERFORMANCE OPPORTUNITIES TO STRENGTHEN THE BONDS THAT MAKE US ONE COMMUNITY.</MissionDesc>
